{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "claim",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 470,
      "y": 663,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 62,
      "text": "## What we say is ours",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "c1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 940,
      "y": 16,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 99,
      "text": "**1 Sept.** A map-first trip planner with budgeting, routing and recommended stops"
    },
    {
      "id": "c2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 940,
      "y": 270,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "**1 Sept.** Narrowed: the shape of a same-airport round trip is the traveller's decision, not a routing accident"
    },
    {
      "id": "c3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 940,
      "y": 550,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 162,
      "text": "~~Nobody does the round trip~~\n\n**6 Sept.** False. Contour ships a loop that goes out one way and comes back another; calimoto exposes it as controls",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "c4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 940,
      "y": 882,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 141,
      "text": "**6 Sept, and this is the claim now**\n\nThe itinerary knows what can break it, and repairs itself from options the group already approved",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "c4f",
      "type": "file",
      "x": 1410,
      "y": 931,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 110,
      "file": "docs/decisions/build-verdict.md"
    },
    {
      "id": "c5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 940,
      "y": 1240,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "The round trip stays as a **secondary** twist, stated narrowly. Worth marks under Novel Features. No longer the headline",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "mech",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 470,
      "y": 2050,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 62,
      "text": "## One mechanism, three jobs",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "m1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 940,
      "y": 1520,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 78,
      "text": "The group votes, and the vote produces the itinerary"
    },
    {
      "id": "m2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 940,
      "y": 1748,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 99,
      "text": "Everything that lost becomes a **ranked bench** - already approved, still on screen"
    },
    {
      "id": "m3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 940,
      "y": 2002,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 78,
      "text": "The bench is the **cut list** when we are over budget"
    },
    {
      "id": "m4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 940,
      "y": 2230,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 99,
      "text": "The bench is the **replacement pool** when a stop closes. A monsoon substitution needs no new vote",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "m5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 940,
      "y": 2510,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 99,
      "text": "**The cost, recorded.** Three behaviours are now coupled. Changing voting changes how disruption recovers",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "enemy",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 470,
      "y": 3516,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 88,
      "text": "## Who we are actually against",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "e1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 940,
      "y": 2790,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 99,
      "text": "**Scan 1, 1 Sept.** Wanderlog, Roadtrippers, Furkot. Killed \"a travel planner\" as a claim"
    },
    {
      "id": "e2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 940,
      "y": 3044,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 99,
      "text": "**Scan 2, 6 Sept.** Contour, calimoto, Locationscout, Sitata. Killed the round trip and the photo page"
    },
    {
      "id": "e3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 940,
      "y": 3324,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 99,
      "text": "**Scan 3, 6 Sept.** Tripeza, SwipeSights, Plan Harmony. Killed voting as a claim"
    },
    {
      "id": "e4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 940,
      "y": 3578,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "**The correction that mattered.** Searching by product shape only surfaces long-tail apps. Search by what a group actually does",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "e5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 940,
      "y": 3884,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "**The real enemy is a five-app stack** - ChatGPT, Google Maps lists, Xiaohongshu, WhatsApp polls, Trip.com. All free, all huge",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "e6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 940,
      "y": 4190,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "**And every one stops at the same place.** None of them holds a committed group plan and repairs it when the world changes",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "e6f",
      "type": "file",
      "x": 1410,
      "y": 4200,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 110,
      "file": "docs/market/competitors.md"
    },
    {
      "id": "build",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -770,
      "y": 608,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 62,
      "text": "## What got built",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "b1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1270,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 99,
      "text": "**Mockup 1.** Map-first: custom map, control panel, round-trip strategy, vote, bench, simulated disruption"
    },
    {
      "id": "b1f",
      "type": "file",
      "x": -1710,
      "y": 10,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 110,
      "file": "docs/prototype/travel-planner.html"
    },
    {
      "id": "b2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1270,
      "y": 280,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "**Mockup 2, 6 Sept.** A slide deck. The map handed to Google Maps, which removed the metered-API feasibility risk"
    },
    {
      "id": "b3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1270,
      "y": 560,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "**Same day.** The deck had quietly dropped the vote, the bench and the substitution - the entire argument. Put back as \"what to do today\"",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "b4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1270,
      "y": 866,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 99,
      "text": "**Merged.** Pages 2 and 3 became one; the hotel became a vote; a read-only final plan is derived from the votes",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "b5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1270,
      "y": 1146,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "Live at codenection-travel-planner.vercel.app. Six bugs found by driving it headlessly, not by looking"
    },
    {
      "id": "drop",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -770,
      "y": 2138,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 62,
      "text": "## Dropped, kept on purpose",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "d1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1270,
      "y": 1426,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 162,
      "text": "~~Day-claiming~~ - 2 Sept\n\nMembers claim days and fill their own stretch. Built and working. Splitting the work between four people does not remove it",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "d2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1270,
      "y": 1758,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 141,
      "text": "~~All-in-one platform~~ - 6 Sept\n\nThe most common thing a team says, the incumbents own it, and Feasibility punishes every thin page",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "d3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1270,
      "y": 2116,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 141,
      "text": "~~Voting is our differentiator~~ - 6 Sept\n\nFour products ship vote-then-generate. Saying it invites a judge to name one",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "d4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1270,
      "y": 2448,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 141,
      "text": "~~Photo spots as a feature~~ - 6 Sept\n\nXiaohongshu, not PhotoHound, is what beats it: 300m users planning around check-in spots",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "d5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1270,
      "y": 2780,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "**Kept from day-claiming.** Must-go places, and the principle \"we plan it, you veto it\" - which now shapes the whole product",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "d5f",
      "type": "file",
      "x": -1710,
      "y": 2790,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 110,
      "file": "docs/decisions/dropped.md"
    },
    {
      "id": "gap",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -770,
      "y": 3659,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 62,
      "text": "## Still unclaimed - 30 marks",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "g1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1270,
      "y": 3060,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 99,
      "text": "**Diagrams - 8%.** This canvas and the user flow beside it are the start of it"
    },
    {
      "id": "g2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1270,
      "y": 3314,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 78,
      "text": "**Mentors - 7%.** sessions/ is empty and the window closes 13 Sept",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "g3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1270,
      "y": 3568,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "**Breadth - 3%.** One idea logged where the band asks for several compared. The playground ideas predate the 30 Aug release and cannot be used"
    },
    {
      "id": "g4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1270,
      "y": 3874,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "**Target group - 5%.** \"Travellers\" is the 2-3 band. Nobody named, nobody interviewed. Everything above is weaker until this is answered",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "g5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1270,
      "y": 4180,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "**Open Tripeza.** If it already keeps losing swipes as a backup pool, the bench claim is gone and the idea needs rethinking, not repositioning",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "root",
      "type": "text",
      "color": "1",
      "x": -190,
      "y": 2098,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 130,
      "text": "# Travel planner\n\nHow the idea moved,\n1 to 6 September 2026"
    },
    {
      "id": "title",
      "type": "text",
      "color": "4",
      "x": -230,
      "y": 1588,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 319,
      "text": "# The ideation, drawn\n\nSix days. Four claims killed, one left standing.\n\nEvery branch here is something that actually happened in `docs/decisions/iteration-log.md` - nothing is invented to fill the picture. The four struck-through branches are worth marks twice over: as the ideation process, and as the dropped directions.\n\nPair this with `user-flow.canvas`, which draws what a group does start to finish."
    },
    {
      "id": "legend",
      "type": "text",
      "color": "6",
      "x": -230,
      "y": 2288,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 314,
      "text": "## How to read this\n\n**Red** is a question still open. **Cyan** is a live branch. **Green** is what survived pressure and is the claim today. **Yellow** is a cost or a caveat. **Purple, struck through**, is a branch we dropped - kept on purpose, because dead ends are scored twice here.\n\nThe **edge labels** are the argument. An arrow with no label says only \"these are related\", which the reader already assumed.\n\nDrag anything. Delete nothing."
    }
  ],
